        "Id": "62eae548-12ae-4751-a75d-f6961df348ca",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Muffin Men",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122243348415",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. As you know, the small town of Whittleton Creek is a seemingly innocuous town, but what you may not know is that it hides some dark secrets. In particular, a source of ours has confirmed that former KGB spymaster Janus and local resident Helen West are operating a business that secretly kills people and bakes their remains into muffins. The ICA wants this business to be eradicated, and we have tasked you with killing their most important assets.",
